          %p
            This page is about
            %strong direct images of sheaves
            and related subjects. For the set-theoretic operation, see
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/image"} image
          %hr/
          %h1#contents Contents
          .maruku_toc
            %ul
              %li
                %a{:href => "#idea"} Idea
              %li
