                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ≔
                  %msub
                    %mi p
                    %mo !
                  %mi F
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma_c(X,F) \coloneqq p_! F
            and calls this group a group of sections of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
            with compact support. If
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
